From bf374437f08f60b66d2317051fbb6515987548f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 13:09:54 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] POSE-1 Riptusk v1 candidate clips (flag still off)

faint: bramblebun_quadruped_anatomical's faint verbatim (identical quadruped rig contract);
ends lying on its side, pivot [0,0,90], legs slack. rest: stormursa_native_adult's rest
(rig contract within 0.2), a settled half-lean with folded legs and the head lowered,
retimed to settle by phase 0.4 and hold. Replaces P2-028's upright head-raised crouch and
P2-029's legacy belly-up rest roll. Renders still to be judged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
